<QuestionLayout
  title="Does Traverse support Windows, macOS, and Linux?"
  description="Native — Linux, macOS, and Windows — is Traverse's default, most mature, shipped target. The same WASM binary runs on all three through traverse-runtime's Wasmtime-backed executor."
  canonical="https://traverse-framework.com/questions/does-traverse-support-windows-macos-and-linux.html"
